  "description": "I've found myself trapped in a mature-rated novel as a cursed cat, whose mere existence is believed to be harmful to the empire. This place has killed every cat in every alley all because of one prophecy... The moment anyone finds me will be my last moment in this life. \n\n*\"What's this?\"* \n\nBefore I could even think of escaping, the male lead, who's fated to become a mad tyrant, effortlessly snatches me up. \n\n(Source: POCKET COMICS)",
